{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31031","headline":"蔡州蒋亭 · 薛能","name":"蔡州蒋亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"草径彻林间，过桥如入山。\n蔡侯添水榭，蒋氏本柴关。\n静泛穷幽趣，惊飞湿醉颜。\n恨无优俸买，来得暂时闲。\n步与招提接，舟临夕照还。\n春风应不到，前想负花湾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31031.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31031","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}